    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) on a **DRUKHARI** unit of yours not yet picked to fight this phase. For the rest of the phase:\n\n- its models add 1 to their **[Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)**\n- if their attacks destroy your [Contract](vsdata:ability/drukhari.kabalite-cartel.murderous-agenda) unit, each unit in the opponent's army takes a [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)\n\nFailures on those tests can earn you at most 3 [Pain tokens](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain).",
